# "When this land enters, surveil 1" (CR 701.25): Bot1 plays Surveillance Room (untapped: nothing says it enters tapped) and puts the
# Lightning Bolt it looks at into the graveyard, so Black Lotus is now on top. "{T}: Add {C}" adds one colorless mana.

[Bot1 Deck]
Surveillance Room
Island x6
Lightning Bolt
Black Lotus
Counterspell

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Surveillance Room.Play
Bot1.Arrange( | Lightning Bolt)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Surveillance Room.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Surveillance Room.Activate(Ability: Add {C})
? Bot1.Mana = {C}
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Library = Black Lotus; Counterspell
Bot1.Battlefield.Surveillance Room.Tapped = true
